DTEND:20261115T110000Z
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Cheap power ≤ €10 11:30-12:00 (confirmed)
DESCRIPTION:Wholesale power in Spain is at or below €10/MWh from 11:30 to
  12:00 Madrid time on Sun 15 Nov 2026. Lowest €6.03/MWh\, average €7.8
 6/MWh.\nConfirmed: OMIE day-ahead market result\, published around 13:00 M
 adrid time the day before.\nPVPC (regulated 2.0TD tariff): about 6.1 c/kWh
  in these hours\, period P3 valle (11:30–12:00). Grid tolls and charges 
 still apply\, so retail power is never free\; it is just at its cheapest.\
 nGood hours to run the dishwasher or washing machine\, charge an EV or hea
 t water.\nWholesale price\, not your retail bill.\nSource: OMIE (omie.es).
  More: https://jvanders22.github.io/spain-negative-price-alert/calendar/
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://jvanders22.github.io/spain-negative-price-alert/calendar/
